{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1407650-shantytown-of-the-awesome-building-and-manse-3e-homebrew","id":1407650,"title":"Shantytown of the Awesome (Building and Manse 3e homebrew)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-08-11T19:52:11-07:00","id":1407650,"title":"Shantytown of the Awesome (Building and Manse 3e homebrew)","content":"Manses are some of my favorite parts of Exalted. Your own magical base filled with awesomeness where you can kick back and relax after a hard day of saving the world or consuming a baffling amount of drugs, sometimes both. But then we find out that manses are barely given any detail in 3e and we're probably a year (or more) out from the 3e manse book <i>Towers of the Mighty</i>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1CsnrAOj6K7GtPAwPl_ZIeyAJhalUs-fXE1ivmZnP4Fg/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">So I said to hell with waiting and made my own version of it</a>.<br /> <br /> So what do you find in this document?<ul><li>Detailed rules on how mundane Buildings and facilities function, how they relate to all aspects of the system (From construction to sieges) and such facilities relate to manses.</li> <li>Oodles of special facilities to make your building extra awesome. Have a Library the size of a mansion, make your building nearly invisible to the naked eye, make deadly traps to challenge and enrage players such as invisible blocks over deep chasms. Upgrade your manse with special manse specific options such as making it a flying castle, exist in several locations at once, or even make Factory-Cathedrals! Powerful, but this time balanced enough to not make your Storyteller cry rivers of blood!</li> <li>Mundane facilities that give welcome, but not gamebreaking benefits. You'll actually want to use them!</li> <li>Half dozen sample manses pre-made and ready to use.</li> <li>Built-in Heaven's Reach functionality for those who use Sci-fi settings.</li> </ul><br /> Don't wait, go make your own casinos with blackjack and hookers today!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Read my shit at my <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/271207-sandact6-homebrew-topic\" target=\"_blank\">homebrew</a> topic, 2.5e and 3e material!<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263020-alchemicals-2-0-3e-conversion-charm-design-request\" target=\"_blank\">Play Alchemical's in 3e now</a>, you're welcome.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1183-sandact6","name":"Sandact6","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1183_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1236"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}